From dc848567f431368668521a74eb55c6a2425dfe93 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Hanro <hlareman2@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 22 Nov 2026 23:33:39 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] WM Shell: optional desktop caption provider hook

Optional @DynamicOverride DesktopCaptionFactory lets a SystemUI variant host a caption
provider surface per task; absent = stock. SurfacePackage gains a hidden touchable-region
setter so only provider-declared button regions take input; the rest of the caption stays
Shell's drag strip. Maximize enters desktop immersive (exclusive full screen).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01HaUq5t3s78G1bwWoNFi22L
